{"id":"tombe_e","lemma":"tombée","pos":"noun","rank":1224,"glosses":["fall (act of falling)","the arranging of a small quantity of something on a plate"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bd/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-tomb%C3%A9e.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-tomb%C3%A9e.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tombées"},"formAudio":{"tombées":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e1/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-tomb%C3%A9es.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Beaucoup de neige est tombée.","en":"A lot of snow has fallen.","words":[{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"snow"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Elles sont tombées.","en":"They fell.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/249741","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Elle n'est jamais tombée amoureuse.","en":"She's never fallen in love.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/653640","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"never"},null,{"g":"in love","l":"amoureux"}]},{"text":"Elle est tombée en amour avec moi.","en":"She has fallen in love with me.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"love"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"me"}]},{"text":"Nous sommes toutes tombées d'accord.","en":"We all agreed.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"all","l":"tout"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"agreement"}]}]}